=== {{S|étymologie}} ===
: ''(Nom 1)'' {{sigle|en}} Initiales de ''{{lien|artificial intelligence|en}}'' (« [[intelligence artificielle]] »).
: ''(Nom 2)'' {{sigle|en}} Initiales de ''{{lien|analog|en}} {{lien|input|en}}''.
: ''(Nom 3)'' {{sigle|en}} Initiales de ''{{lien|artificial insemination|en}}''.

=== {{S|nom|en|num=1}} ===
{{en-nom-rég|ˈeɪ.ˈaɪ}}
'''AI''' {{pron|ˈeɪ.ˈaɪ|en}}
# {{lexique|science-fiction|en}} {{lexique|marketing|en}} [[intelligence artificielle|Intelligence artificielle]], [[IA]].
#* {{exemple | lang=en
 | And therein lies the problem: as Wikipedia’s visibility diminishes, reduced to mere training data for '''AI''' applications, it also loses prominence in the minds of readers and potential contributors. When someone notices a topic that is poorly described on Wikipedia, they might feel motivated to correct it. But this can-do spirit goes away when the error comes through an '''AI''' summary, where the source of the information isn’t clear.
 | source = Stephen Harrison, ''Wikipedia is facing an existential crisis. Can gen Z save it?'', The Guardian, 12 septembre 2024
}}


==== {{S|dérivés}} ====
* {{lien|AI-complete|en}}
* {{lien|AIBOM|en|nom}}

=== {{S|nom|en|num=2}} ===
{{en-nom-rég|ˈeɪ.ˈaɪ}}
'''AI''' {{pron|ˈeɪ.ˈaɪ|en}} 
# {{lexique|informatique|en}} Entrée analogique.
#* {{exemple | lang=en
 | Four general categories of computer interface signals are involved: Digital Inputs (DI), Analog Inputs ('''AI'''), Digital Outputs (DO) and Analog Outputs (AO). The DIs, usually implemented with TTL compatible OV or +5V logic signals, provide inputs from switches and other digital sources. The '''AIs''' provide inputs from potentiometer type transducers and other analog sources 1n the form of d.c. voltages, typically in the −10V to +10V range.
 | source=Instrument Society of America, ''Advances in Instrumentation: Proceedings of the 38th ISA Conference'', 1983, {{ISBN|9780876647806}}}}

==== {{S|vocabulaire}} ====
* {{lien|AO|en}}
* {{lien|DI|en}}
* {{lien|DO|en}}

=== {{S|nom|en|num=3}} ===
{{en-nom-rég|ˈeɪ.ˈaɪ}}
'''AI''' {{pron|ˈeɪ.ˈaɪ|en}} 
# {{lexique|agriculture|en}} [[insémination artificielle#fr|Insémination artificielle]].

==== {{S|synonymes}} ====
* [[artificial insemination]]

=== {{S|références}} ===
* {{R:Merriam-Webster}}

[[Catégorie:Lexique en anglais de l’intelligence artificielle|*]]

